Galadriel was voiced by [[Annette Crosbie]] in [[Ralph Bakshi]]'s 1978 animated film of ''[[The Lord of the Rings (1978 film)|The Lord of the Rings]]'',<ref name="Beck 2005">{{cite book |last=Beck |first=Jerry |title=The Animated Movie Guide |url=https://books.google.com/books?id=fTI1yeZd-tkC&pg=PA154 |year=2005 |publisher=[[Chicago Review Press]] |isbn=978-1-56976-222-6 |page=154}}</ref> and by Marian Diamond in [[BBC Radio]]'s [[The Lord of the Rings (1981 radio series)|1981 serialisation]].<ref>{{cite web |title=Riel Radio Theatre — The Lord of the Rings, Episode 2 |url=https://radioriel.org/content/daily-programme/riel-radio-theatre-the-lord-of-the-rings-episode-2/ |publisher=Radioriel |access-date=18 May 2020 |date=15 January 2009 |archive-date=15 January 2020 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200115144511/https://www.radioriel.org/content/daily-programme/riel-radio-theatre-the-lord-of-the-rings-episode-2/ |url-status=dead }}</ref> She did not appear in the 1980 animated ''[[The Return of the King (1980 film)|The Return of the King]]'', but was mentioned by name when Frodo refers to "Galadriel's phial".<ref>{{cite web |last=Helen |first=Daniel |title=Deluxe edition of the Rankin/Bass Hobbit and Return of the King released |url=https://www.tolkiensociety.org/2014/07/deluxe-edition-of-the-rankinbass-hobbit-and-return-of-the-king-released/ |publisher=[[The Tolkien Society]] |access-date=1 July 2020 |date=22 July 2014}}</ref>

[[File:Galadriel.jpg|thumb|left|[[Cate Blanchett]] as Galadriel in [[Peter Jackson]]'s ''[[The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring]]'']]

In Peter Jackson's ''Lord of the Rings'' and ''The Hobbit'' trilogies, Galadriel is played by [[Cate Blanchett]].<ref name=blanchett>{{cite news |url=http://www.theonering.net/torwp/2010/12/07/41135-torn-exclusive-cate-blanchett-ken-stott-sylvester-mccoy-mikael-persbrandt-join-cast-of-peter-jackson%E2%80%99s-%E2%80%9Cthe-hobbit%E2%80%9D/ |date=7 December 2010 |access-date=7 December 2010 |title=Torn Exclusive: Cate Blanchett, Ken Stott, Sylvester McCoy, Mikael Persbrandt join cast of Peter Jackson's "The Hobbit"}}</ref> In ''[[The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring]]'', Galadriel narrates the prologue that explains the creation of the One Ring, as well as appearing in Lothlórien.<ref name="MOTG">{{cite journal |last=Harl |first=Allison  |title=The monstrosity of the gaze: critical problems with a film adaptation of The Lord of the Rings |date=Spring–Summer 2007 |journal=[[Mythlore]] |volume=25 |issue=3 |at=Article 7 |url=https://dc.swosu.edu/mythlore/vol25/iss3/7 }}</ref> While Galadriel does not feature in Tolkien's ''[[The Hobbit]]'', the story was amended so that she could appear in [[The Hobbit (film series)|Jackson's films based on the book]].<ref>{{cite news |last=Child |first=Ben |title=Peter Jackson tinkers with Tolkien to hand Cate Blanchett Hobbit role |date=8 December 2010 |work=[[The Guardian]] |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2010/dec/08/peter-jackson-cate-blanchett-hobbit |access-date=29 May 2020 }}</ref>

On stage, Galadriel was portrayed by [[Rebecca Jackson Mendoza]] in the 2006 [[Toronto]] musical production of ''[[Lord of the Rings (musical)|The Lord of the Rings]]''; Mendoza's dress was hand-embroidered with 1,800 beads.<ref name="Brantley 2006">{{cite news |last=Brantley |first=Ben |title=Tolkien's 'Lord of the Rings,' Staged by Matthew Warchus in Toronto |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2006/03/24/theater/24ring.html |access-date=29 May 2020 |work=[[The New York Times]] |date=24 March 2006}}</ref> The musical was revised and moved to London's [[Theatre Royal, Drury Lane]] in 2007, with [[Laura Michelle Kelly]] in the "glittering" role.<ref>{{cite news |last=Billington |first=Michael |author-link=Michael Billington (critic) |title=''Guardian'' review, "The Lord of the Rings" |url=https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2007/jun/20/theatre1 |newspaper=[[The Guardian]] |date=19 June 2007 |access-date=22 April 2012}}</ref>

Galadriel appears in video games such as ''[[The Lord of the Rings: The Battle for Middle-earth II]]'', where she is voiced by [[Lani Minella]].<ref>{{cite web |title=Galadriel |url=https://www.behindthevoiceactors.com/video-games/The-Lord-of-the-Rings-The-Battle-for-Middle-Earth-II/Galadriel/ |website=Behind the Voice Actors |access-date=29 May 2020}}</ref>

