In the 2022 television series ''[[The Lord of the Rings: The Rings of Power]]'', Galadriel was portrayed by [[Morfydd Clark]],<ref>{{cite web |url=https://variety.com/2019/tv/news/lord-of-the-rings-series-galadriel-morfydd-clark-1203446284/ |title='Lord of the Rings' Series Taps Morfydd Clark as Young Galadriel |website=[[Variety (magazine)|Variety]] |last=Kroll |first=Justin |date=17 December 2019|access-date=17 December 2019}}</ref> and her younger version by Amelie Child Villiers.<ref name="Welch 2022">{{cite news |last=Welch |first=Andy |title=The Lord of the Rings: The Rings of Power recap episodes one and two – like no TV you've seen before |url=https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/2022/sep/02/the-lord-of-the-rings-the-rings-of-power-recap-episodes-one-and-two-like-no-tv-youve-seen-before |access-date=3 September 2022 |work=[[The Guardian]] |date=2 September 2022}}</ref>

